  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\nWe have to interchange the signs in the given equations to make it correct.\n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) **÷, −, =, −, ÷, ×\n\n**Given: **(120 * 15) * 9 * sqrt[4]{81} * 17 * 28 * 95\n\nAfter putting the sign we get the;\n\n⇒ __**(120 ÷ 15) **__- 9 = sqrt[4]{81} - 17 ÷ 28 × 95\n\n⇒ 8 - 9 = __**sqrt[4]{81}**____** **__- 17 ÷ 28 × 95\n\n⇒ 8 - 9 = 3 - __**17 ÷ 28**__ × 95\n\n⇒ - 1 = 3 - **__0.60 × 95__**\n\n⇒ - 1 =**__ 3 - 57__**\n\n⇒ - 1 ≠ - 54\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) ÷, −, =, −, ×, −\n\nGiven: (120 * 15) * 9 * sqrt[4]{81} * 17 * 28 * 95\n\nAfter putting the sign we get the;\n\n⇒ **__(120 ÷ 15)__** - 9 = sqrt[4]{81} - 17 × 28 - 95\n\n⇒ __**8 - 9**__ = 3 - __**17 × 28**__ - 95\n\n⇒ - 1 = __**3 - 476 - 95**__\n\n⇒ - 1 ≠ - 568\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ×, =, −, ÷, +, −\n\nGiven: (120 * 15) * 9 * sqrt[4]{81} * 17 * 28 * 95\n\nAfter putting the sign we get the;\n\n⇒ __**(120 × 15)**__ = 9 - sqrt[4]{81} ÷ 17 + 28 - 95\n\n⇒ 1800 = 9 - __**3 ÷ 17**__ + 28 - 95\n\n⇒ 1800 =__** 9 - 0.176 + 28 - 95**__\n\n⇒ 1800 ≠ - 58.176\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) ÷, ×, +, ×, −, =\n\nGiven: (120 * 15) * 9 * sqrt[4]{81} * 17 * 28 * 95\n\nAfter putting the sign we get the;\n\n⇒ __**(120 ÷ 15)**__ × 9 + sqrt[4]{81} × 17 - 28 = 95\n\n⇒ __**8 × 9 **__+ sqrt[4]{81} × 17 - 28 = 95\n\n⇒ 72 +__** 3 × 17**__ - 28 = 95\n\n⇒ __**72 + 51** __- 28 = 95\n\n⇒ __**123 - 28**__ = 95\n\n⇒ 95 = 95\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
